      "content": "brave? i don't feel brave. i just feel empty. and like you said, wanting to escape is understandable... but what if there is no way to escape while i'm still here? it feels like as long as i exist, i'm just a puppet for everyone else. i keep thinking about how much easier it would be to just... not be part of this anymore. to finally have some peace that nobody can take away.",
